# Frontend / Figma fidelity

- Treat `src/screens/*`, `src/components/*`, and `src/index.css` tokens as the design source of truth
- Do not redesign layout, copy tone, or interaction patterns unless the phase explicitly includes UI work
- Replace mocks by wiring the same screens to APIs; keep sample data in `src/data/` until removed intentionally
- Prefer Tailwind utilities and existing CSS variables over new parallel design systems
- Export components as default exports (project convention)
- Use double quotes for strings containing apostrophes to avoid build breaks
- Fix only build-blocking issues during bootstrap/foundation unless asked otherwise
